<SCENARIO VER="105">
<VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50"><TXSPN>-sama's imagined branches do not necessarily exist within the scenarios you viewed, but... 
{PAUSE ""}
From their viewpoint... 
{PAUSE ""}
Let me see, there should have been at least three branches.<PG>
Now then, I will guide you to another branch destination, one impossible in reality: 'if, at that time, things had been like this.'<PG>
The branching point that lay closest to the scenario you viewed a moment ago―<PG>
Erina Goto, at that time, toward Haruka Niimura, a different... 
{PAUSE ""}
Heh, from here on, please see with your own eyes.<PG>
Now then, I will again take my leave here. Should you need anything, please call me at any time.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\イラスト\立木三日2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "立木三日,立木ボード,プレート" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
